(Completely voluntary – no features are blocked): (To'liq ixtiyoriy - hech qanday xususiyat bloklanmagan)
(No description): (Ta'rif yo'q)
• Add / rename / delete groups.: • Guruhlarni qo‘shish/nomini o‘zgartirish/o‘chirish.
• Buffer slider: adjust HLS buffer (1‑10 seconds).: • Bufer slayderi: HLS buferini sozlash (1‑10 soniya).
• Check URL availability (only visible channels).: • URL mavjudligini tekshiring (faqat ko'rinadigan kanallar).
• Edit channel names, groups, URLs, logos, tvg-id, country, languages, favorites.: • Kanal nomlarini, guruhlarni, URL manzillarini, logotiplarni, tvg-identifikatorini, mamlakatni, tillarni, sevimlilarni tahrirlash.
• Edit multiple URLs per channel (popup window).: • Har bir kanal uchun bir nechta URL manzillarini tahrirlash (qalqib chiquvchi oyna).
• Enrich with EPG: adds missing tvg-id using fuzzy matching.: • EPG bilan boyitish: noaniq moslik yordamida etishmayotgan tvg-identifikatorini qo'shadi.
• EPG info displayed in status bar for current channel.: • Joriy kanal uchun holat satrida ko'rsatilgan EPG ma'lumotlari.
• Export OK / FAIL / filtered lists as M3U or JSON.: • OK / FAIL / filtrlangan roʻyxatlarni M3U yoki JSON sifatida eksport qiling.
• Fetch logos from remote repository (OwnerPlugins/logos).: • Logotiplarni masofaviy ombordan oling (OwnerPlugins/logos).
• Fullscreen UI: hides sidebar and status bar (ESC to exit).: • To‘liq ekranli UI: yon panel va holat panelini yashiradi (chiqish uchun ESC).
• Hide/Show channel list button.: • Kanallar ro‘yxatini yashirish/ko‘rsatish tugmasi.
• Import JSON (local or URL) with flexible field mapping (auto-detect, save mapping).: • JSON (mahalliy yoki URL)ni moslashuvchan maydon xaritasi bilan import qiling (avtomatik aniqlash, xaritani saqlash).
• Picture‑in‑Picture (PIP) button.: • Tasvir ichidagi rasm (PIP) tugmasi.
• Playback speed: 0.5x, 1x, 2x buttons.: • Ijro qilish tezligi: 0,5x, 1x, 2x tugmalari.
• Sort any column by clicking header; use 'Reset Order' to revert to original order.: • Sarlavhani bosish orqali istalgan ustunni saralash; asl tartibni qaytarish uchun "Buyurtmani tiklash" dan foydalaning.
• Timeshift: pause live stream; drag slider to seek back; press 'Live' to return.: • Timeshift: jonli translatsiyani to‘xtatib turish; orqaga qaytish uchun slayderni torting; qaytish uchun "Jonli" tugmasini bosing.
◀ Previous: ◀ Oldingi
16 colour themes + Light/Dark variants.: 16 ta rangli mavzular + Ochiq/qora variantlar.
A new version is available. Do you want to update now?: Yangi versiya mavjud. Hozir yangilashni xohlaysizmi?
Access via 'Compare' button in Playlist Editor or Tools menu.: Pleylist muharriri yoki Asboblar menyusidagi “Taqqoslash” tugmasi orqali kiring.
Access via 'Edit Playlist' button on main toolbar.: Asosiy asboblar panelidagi “Pleylistni tahrirlash” tugmasi orqali kiring.
